{"title":"2019 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_9\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Problem 9</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 9\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/a/81a1fbb8951975f2af152b5c26c760e5adc0cfdf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(a,b) = \\dfrac{a}{b} + \\dfrac{b}{a} + \\dfrac{1}{ab}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"170\" height=\"39\" />. For example, the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/d/eedb031d99fdbc698f81eeb1dd3a9c5806f18e90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"53\" height=\"20\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Parts\">Parts</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Parts\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_9a\" t